DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerWine Down SFDo you like scary 
 movies? Wine Down SF’s monthly Pop Culture Trivia Night is going Y2K wit
 h a Halloween twist. We’re conjuring up questions on the music\, movies\
 , and pop culture moments from the decade that brought us so much (and hau
 nts us still). Each month we tackle a different era\, and October is the s
 pookiest one yet.\nGather your coven (or come solo and we’ll help you fi
 nd a team) for fun rounds\, friendly competition\, and plenty of wine\, be
 er\, NA drinks\, and snacks. Prizes go to 1st and 2nd place\, plus special
  awards for Best Small Team\, Best Team Name\, and Best Dressed. Early 200
 0s and Halloween costumes encouraged!\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.wine
 downsf.com/partyrsvp.html\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/scary-early-20
 00s-pop-culture-trivia/\nSource: Funcheap SF
