BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Night the Witches Were Invited In
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T210000
DTSTAMP:20261018T205153Z
UID:funcheap-1641786@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerChelsea SwineaFriday\, October
  23 | Pelican Inn\nSince opening\, the Pelican Inn has had its ways of kee
 ping witches out\, from glass worked into the fireplace mortar to a horse
 ’s head buried beneath the hearth. But on this night\, we’re turning t
 radition on its head and inviting the witches in!\n\nJoin us for a magical
  collaboration with Practical Magic of Fairfax. At 6:00 PM\, Lea will lead
  a handcrafted broom-making class ($75\, all supplies included). Browse th
 e Practical Magic pop-up shop for spell candles\, jewelry\, and other magi
 cal treasures\, then enjoy dinner and drinks at the inn.\nAt 8:00 PM\, we
 ’ll gather around the fire\, where we’ll come together for a magical r
 itual led by Caitlin.\nCome make a broom\, discover something magical\, an
 d gather with us by the fire. For one night\, the witches aren’t being k
 ept out. They’re being invited in.\n\n$75.00\n\nTickets: https://www.ins
 tagram.com/pelicaninn/p/DeQEcEbj3MD/?hl=en\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.c
 om/night-witches-invited/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Witch-
 Poster.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261018T205153Z
LOCATION:Pelican Inn\, 10 Pacific Way
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/night-witches-invited/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:“Midnight at the Masquerade” Murder Mystery Dinner
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T210000
