DESCRIPTION:CrawlSF Presents\nSan Francisco Halloween Bar Crawl 2026\nSatu
 rday\, October 24 | Mayes Oyster House\n\nA great Halloween costume deserv
 es more than one night.\n\nOn Saturday\, October 24\, 2026\, CrawlSF is gi
 ving San Francisco an extra chance to dress up with the opening event of i
 ts four-day Halloween Pub Crawl. The party takes place one week before Hal
 loween and includes more than 20 bars\, drink specials\, DJs\, contests\, 
 party favors and activities.\n\nThe event runs from 4PM to 10PM\, starting
  with check-in at Mayes Oyster House. Located at 1233 Polk Street\, Mayes 
 will serve as the place where participants collect their official wristban
 ds before visiting the remaining bars.\n\nOnce check-in is complete\, gues
 ts can arrange the evening around their own interests. There is no require
 d order for visiting locations and no single group that everyone must foll
 ow. Participants can remain at one bar for a while\, make a quick tour of 
 several stops or meet different groups of friends at locations along the r
 oute.\n\nThe participating lineup includes neighborhood bars\, restaurants
 \, dance spots and music venues. Official locations include Mayes Oyster H
 ouse\, Union Street Ale House\, Route 101\, El Lopo\, Rick & Roxy’s\, Ha
