 r\, Uni Pizza\, Wizards & Wands\, Campus\, White Rabbit\, Silver Cloud\, M
 usic City Starfactory\, Sacred Taco\, Comet Club\, Rockwell\, McTeague’s
  Saloon and Westwood.\n\nEach bar offers another place to show off costume
 s\, take gro...\n\n$12 - $45\, 21+\nCrawlSF Presents\n\nDetails: https://d
 othebay.com/events/2026/10/24/san-francisco-halloween-bar-crawl-2026-ticke
