DESCRIPTION:Palm HousePalm House hosts its fourth annual Halloween Bark Ba
 sh\, a dog brunch and fashion show where costumed dogs take the runway and
  compete for best dressed and other prizes. Dog attendees can receive swag
  bags\, and aspiring dog owners can access adoption coupons. The event als
 o includes specialty cocktails from Tito’s and participation from Modern
  Animal. Dogs interested in the fashion show can email suki@palmhousesf.co
 m with their name\, tricks\, or other runway details.\nOriginal Event Desc
 ription:\nPalm House Halloween Bark Bash: Dog Brunch & Fashion Show\nGet r
 eady for the ultimate doggie fashion show at Bark Bash\, where furry model
 s strut their stuff in their best Halloween Costumes!Calling all dog lover
 s! Dress your fashionable pups in their spooky season best for the chance 
 to win prizes for best dressed and other categories! Swag bags will be ava
 ilable for dog attendees & adoption coupons for aspiring dog owners.For al
 l pups that would like to participate\, please email suki@palmhousesf.com 
 and provide your pups name and any fun tricks or unique flairs you want to
  show off on the runway!For our hoomans\, we are partnering with Titos to 
 bring you specialty cocktails and Modern Animal will also be joining us as
  well!\nHoused in the original 1854 dairy farmhouse where Cow Hollow deriv
 es its name and situated behind the second oldest palm tree in San Francis
 co\, Palm House opened in June of 2014 as San Francisco’s staycation des
 tination\, serving tropical food and vacation-ins...\n\nFree\n\nTickets: h
 ttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/palm-house-halloween-bark-bash-dog-brunch-fash
 ion-show-tickets-2003533561817\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/2026-bark
 -bash-dog-costume-runway-prizes-palm-house-sf/\nSource: Funcheap SF
