 rom community colleges and universities\, public and private\, alongside c
 areer-changers and working professionals for one relaxed evening of brain 
 games\, real conversations\, Mini Keynotes and a raffle. Come curious. No 
 neuroscience degree or prior knowledge required.\n\nThis is a free mixer w
 ith free food for college and university students and professionals who ar
 e curious about the brain. Meet new people\, enjoy the free food and drink
 s\, and we’ll also be raffling off tickets to Andrew Huberman’s 7:30 P
 M “Protocols” show in SF.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://neuronightsf.org
