DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerrafikiIn this engaging communi
 ty conversation\, Dr. Talia Moore explores how trauma affects our minds\, 
 bodies\, families\, and neighborhoods\, while offering practical tools for
  building resilience and supporting healing. Through real-life examples\, 
 research\, and meaningful discussion\, participants will gain a better und
 erstanding of trauma\, why it matters\, and how we can create healthier\, 
 stronger communities together. Whether you’re supporting a loved one\, w
 orking in your community\, or simply looking for hope and understanding\, 
