DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerDrink & Draw Art Event & Raffl
 e | The Knockout\nLfelipelopezp\nAt Drink and Draw\, artsy bar patrons dra
 w to a theme and submit their artwork into a raffle for cocktails and othe
 r prizes at The Knockout in the Mission District. The artwork gets scanned
  online for all to admire.\nDrink and Draw happens every first Wednesday o
